--- !u!114 &898960027
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 898960026}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 37613ba843604cd45a467b390a7b7f57, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LuckyNumber.UI.CutsceneManager
  customCutsceneFont: {fileID: 0}
  typewriterCharDelay: 0.018
  playIntroOnStart: 1
  introSlides:
  - chapterTitle: 'CHAPTER 1: AETHERIA ISLAND & ELDORIA VILLAGE'
    narrativeText: In the vast ocean of Aetheria Island stood a prosperous village called Eldoria Village, guided by Village Chief Arvand. For centuries, peace and fertility flourished beneath the protection of an ancient artifact.
    artwork: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9c40c626e30c4df44ab995f3f33d17a0, type: 3}
  - chapterTitle: 'THE HOKI ARTIFACT: ANCIENT SEAL OF FORTUNE'
    narrativeText: The sacred relic was known as HOKI, bearing two sacred numbers, 6 and 7, enshrined upon the altar at the heart of Eldoria Village. As long as the HOKI Artifact remained whole, waters ran clear and the people remained safe from calamity.
    artwork: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 32829a9cae165ec4382ff942d2fc8564, type: 3}
  - chapterTitle: 'CHAPTER 2: AWAKENING OF ANCIENT DEMON VORTHAK'
    narrativeText: Yet one fateful night, an ancient demon named Vorthak sealed beneath the altar sought to break free. Vorthak summoned four demon lieutenants to shatter the seal, breaking the HOKI Artifact into four fragments!
    artwork: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ab6d55797dc8de447a73530abe33fab1, type: 3}
  - chapterTitle: 'CHAPTER 3: FOUR DEMON GUARDIANS OF HOKI'
    narrativeText: 'The four HOKI fragments were scattered across the island by the four demons: Ignaroth (Fire), Glaciera (Ice), Venomark (Poison), and Nocthar (Shadow). A dark curse spread rapidly, withering crops, tainting rivers, and bringing Eldoria Village to the verge of ruin.'
    artwork: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7c66904b4a11dec41902411b14b1c93e, type: 3}
  - chapterTitle: 'CHAPTER 4: THE JOURNEY OF MALIOS BEGINS'
    narrativeText: Chief Arvand sent an urgent plea to Eldric in Valoria Village, who called upon a courageous hero named Malios. "Track down the four demons, conquer their trials in order, and return all 4 HOKI fragments to the altar in Eldoria Village!"
    artwork: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8f860df9728ef4d47b4883f52eb65faa, type: 3}
  endingSlides:
  - chapterTitle: 'FINAL CHAPTER: THE LAST HOKI FRAGMENT'
    narrativeText: After an intense trial in Shadow Castle, Malios finally triumphed over Nocthar! The dark shadows faded away as the fourth HOKI fragment emitted a mystical glow. All 4 fragments have at last been gathered!
    artwork: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 54e425bbaa1b25142a29a79bdd2f7edc, type: 3}
  - chapterTitle: RESTORING THE FOUR HOKI FRAGMENTS
    narrativeText: Malios returned to the sacred grounds of Eldoria Village. Standing before the cracked altar, Chief Arvand guided Malios to restore the four HOKI fragments back into their sacred positions, reuniting the ancient artifact.
    artwork: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 237b3ee83104e30459899d342968fc99, type: 3}
  - chapterTitle: THE POWER OF SIXSEVEN & SEALING VORTHAK
    narrativeText: Suddenly the earth trembled violently as Vorthak attempted to emerge from beneath the altar! "Malios! Do not let HOKI lose its radiance!" cried Arvand. Malios channeled the ultimate power of SIXSEVEN, uniting numbers 6 and 7 with the light of HOKI to seal Vorthak away once and for all!
    artwork: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4a54761997672d54b878ed8d38f15f3a, type: 3}
  - chapterTitle: 'GUARDIAN OF HOKI: PEACE RESTORED TO ELDORIA'
    narrativeText: 'The ancient curse vanished across the island. The villagers rejoiced, and Chief Arvand presented a medal of eternal honor to Malios: "Thanks to your courage, the HOKI Artifact shines once more, safeguarding the harmony of Aetheria Island!"'
    artwork: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ca8728a852a97f540a9122a6c2230b59, type: 3}
